#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F/scripts.inc:68
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_Text_ShowMeCompletedDex"
msgid ""
"I'm the GAME DESIGNER.\p"
"Oh, is that right?\n"
"You're working on a POKéDEX?\p"
"It's tough trying to complete it,\n"
"but don't give up.\p"
"If you do complete it, please come\n"
"show me.$"
msgstr ""
"我是游戏设计师。\p"
"哦，是吗？\n"
"你在完成宝可梦图鉴？\p"
"要完成它可不容易，\n"
"但是不要放弃哦。\p"
"如果你完成了，\n"
"请拿来给我看看。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F/scripts.inc:77
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_Text_FilledPokedexGiveYouThis"
msgid ""
"Wow! That's awesome!\n"
"Yep, it's totally awesome!\p"
"This POKéDEX is completely filled!\n"
"You really must love POKéMON!\p"
"I'm so impressed!\p"
"Let me give you something in\n"
"recognition of your feat!$"
msgstr ""
"哇！太厉害了！\n"
"没错，真的太厉害了！\p"
"这本图鉴完全填满了！\n"
"你一定非常喜欢宝可梦吧！\p"
"我太佩服你了！\p"
"为了表彰你的成就，\n"
"我送你一样东西吧！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F/scripts.inc:86
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_Text_ImTheProgrammer"
msgid ""
"Me? You're talking to me?\n"
"I'm the PROGRAMMER.\p"
"I wonder what the SLOTS are\n"
"like here.$"
msgstr ""
"我？你在和我说话？\n"
"我是程序员。\p"
"不知道这里的老虎机\n"
"是什么样的呢。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F/scripts.inc:92
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_Text_ImTheGraphicArtist"
msgid ""
"I'm the GRAPHIC ARTIST! Aren't the\n"
"POKéMON of HOENN interesting?$"
msgstr ""
"我是美术设计师！丰缘地区的\n"
"宝可梦是不是很有意思？$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F/scripts.inc:96
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_Text_GirlsAreCute"
msgid ""
"The girl TUBERS, they're cute, hey?\n"
"To battle against a cute TUBER…\p"
"Whoop, it's so awesome!\p"
"And the TWINS! Aren't they cute?\n"
"A 2-on-2 battle with TWINS…\p"
"Whoop, it's unbearably fun!$"
msgstr ""
"泳圈小女孩很可爱吧？\n"
"和可爱的泳圈小女孩对战……\p"
"哇哦，太棒了！\p"
"还有双胞胎！是不是很可爱？\n"
"和双胞胎来一场2对2的对战……\p"
"哇哦，开心得受不了！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F/scripts.inc:104
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_Text_SeaBreezeTicklesHeart"
msgid ""
"The sea breeze tickles my heart.\n"
"It feels wonderful here!$"
msgstr ""
"海风轻轻拂过我的心。\n"
"这里的感觉真好！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F/scripts.inc:108
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_Text_NeverLeaveWithoutGameBoy"
msgid ""
"You never know when and where\n"
"people will challenge you.\p"
"That's why I never leave home without\n"
"my GAME BOY ADVANCE.$"
msgstr ""
"你永远不知道什么时候、\n"
"在什么地方会有人向你挑战。\p"
"所以我出门一定会带上\n"
"我的GAME BOY ADVANCE。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F/scripts.inc:114
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_Text_SnoozingPreferBattles"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Zzz…\p"
"… … … … … Huh?!\n"
"Oh, sorry, sorry! I was snoozing!\p"
"I came to check out this POKéMON\n"
"CONTEST thing.\p"
"I have to admit, it does look quite\n"
"entertaining, but…\p"
"Consider me a purist--I prefer\n"
"battles and tough TRAINERS.\p"
"But that's just me.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I hope you'll enjoy everything\n"
"like the GYMS, CONTESTS, BATTLE TENT,\l"
"the whole works!$"
msgstr ""
"亚希达：…… …… ……\n"
"…… …… 呼噜……\p"
"…… …… 嗯？！\n"
"哎呀，抱歉抱歉！我在打瞌睡！\p"
"我是来看看这个\n"
"宝可梦华丽大赛的。\p"
"不得不承认，看起来\n"
"确实很有意思，不过……\p"
"我是个死脑筋——我更喜欢\n"
"对战和强大的训练家。\p"
"不过这只是我个人的喜好。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，希望你能尽情享受\n"
"道馆、华丽大赛、对战帐篷，\l"
"所有的一切！$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F/scripts.inc:130
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_Text_ContestsDoTakeStrategy"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: I think it does take strategy\n"
"to win a CONTEST.\p"
"Devising CONTEST strategies is one way\n"
"of becoming a better TRAINER, I'd say.$"
msgstr ""
"亚希达：我觉得要赢得华丽大赛，\n"
"确实需要策略。\p"
"我认为，思考华丽大赛的策略\n"
"也是成为更好的训练家的一种方法。$"
